  "standing_scope": "The surrounding paper uses q a nonnegative integer and 2q+1<d. The local estimates use integer r=q+1≥1, positive integer d, a fixed row 1≤i≤d, and its N(0,I_r) marginal. Source context is indexed in the prior broad graph.",
